算、不补零、不计算年龄或派生量，不选择最新或有利结果。原整数、原日历日期和旧无时区时钟只允许引用完整字面值；不得增加Z、时区、精度或转换为另一类型。文本引文保留BOM、CRLF、emoji和组合字符，start/end使用Unicode码点半开区间，不使用UTF8字节或UTF16单元。\n没有原记录、NULL、日期未知、无候选或空输出不能证明未测、不适用、正常或疾病不存在。文字中明确未测、不适用或矛盾的表述仅可标记为待核实引文分类，分类本身不是已验证缺失状态。必须保留能限定引文含义的否定、条件、单位和上下文，不能用局部引文歪曲原意；区间正确也不代表医学含义正确。\n输出仅为闭集JSON：schema_version=research_variable_draft_v1、coverage=partial_candidates_only、candidates数组。每项仅含member_token、record_token、field_token、variable_key、value_kind、classification、start、end、quote。classification只能是value_quote_candidate、not_measured_quote_candidate、not_applicable_quote_candidate或conflict_quote_candidate。非文本原字段只可使用value_quote_candidate。最多128项，不重复或重叠同一字段的区间；没有可核实字面候选时返回空数组，不编造完整变量矩阵、诊断、结论、总分、CSV、额外说明或代码围栏。","type":"string"},{"maxLength":65535,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"actor_epoch":[237],"batch_publication":[238],"catalog_version":[36],"feature_validation":[239],"payload":[240],"prompt_origin":[241],"provider_snapshot":[242],"run_clock_basis":[243],"schema_version":[244],"system_prompt":[245],"task_prompt":[246]},["schema_version","catalog_version","system_prompt","task_prompt","prompt_origin","payload","provider_snapshot","feature_validation","batch_publication","actor_epoch","run_clock_basis"],{"$defs":[236],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":[247],"required":[248],"type":"object"},{"LiteralDocument":[65],"RecordWindow":[35],"VariableDefinition":[53],"VariableSourceRecipe":[173],"VariableSourceRecord":[185]},{"pattern":"^rv_authority:[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},{"pattern":"^rv_collection:[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},{"pattern":"^rv_dictionary:[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/LiteralDocument"},{"items":[254],"maxItems":8192,"type":"array"},["unknown","recorded_permitted","not_permitted"],{"enum":[256],"type":"string"},{"items":[60],"maxItems":5,"type":"array"},{"items":[15],"maxItems":256,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},{"const":"purpose_authorized_identifier_minimization_not_anonymity","type":"string"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/VariableSourceRecip